silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_4#typedlegtaxonomy_tsn_183798 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.01_orientation.chapters.14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline.sections.05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow.concrete_anchor_4#typedlegtaxonomy_tsn_183798" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_concrete_anchor_4#typedlegtaxonomy_tsn_183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedLegTaxonomy_TSN_183798 is TypedLeg_taxonomy represents the taxonomy source leg as a typed olog object: the ITIS row TaxRow_TSN_183798 (Felis catus, rank Species, valid status) carrying the identification arrow lambda_tax into Mittens. The taxonomy leg is one of the ten cocone legs glue requires; it is preserved separately from the classification leg (DomesticCat) so the negative-regression \"Mittens = catus\" cannot fire." .
